  "notes": [
    "Original Forge visual system, locally authored native images, eight-bar original music and frame-driven motion. Upstream source code or artwork was not copied.",
    "Three independent 15-second, 30-fps builds: 45 seconds, 1350 encoded frames and 4050 actual temporal captures. Every build uses the current production engine fingerprint.",
    "The portable inventory verifies bytes and declarations. Actual full-frame decoding, PCM, DOM, shutter and sampled visual records were produced separately; this inventory is not an aesthetic certificate.",
    "Independent fresh full-resolution visual samples: horizontal 10, portrait 12, square 20. Horizontal and portrait byte-identical binding preserves previously reviewed 20 frames and 89 encoded contact cells; square has a fresh 89-cell encoded sheet review.",
    "Chrome 155 muted automated playback reached ended at rate 1 for each 450-frame MP4, with zero dropped or corrupted frames and no browser errors. No complete human normal-speed viewing or listening was performed.",
    "No non-brand low-change interval of at least 0.5 seconds at the measured low-resolution threshold. Final brand holds for about 1.53 seconds. This pixel metric does not certify semantics, all movement or taste.",
    "Three-exposure motion has discrete ghosts in fast sections. It is not photographic continuous shutter blur.",
    "The score preset is currently fixed at 128 BPM, eight 4/4 bars and 15 seconds. Other durations use existing external local music assets.",
    "Raw temporary temporal PNGs were deleted after composition. Hash records remain; independent recomposition of deleted PNGs is not claimed.",
    "Historical alpha 2 media and creative rejection, failed previews, source-freeze render rejection and test failures are retained. Current results do not replace old failed states.",
    "Independent creative-review.json SHA256: 91b9f67e59330587c922acb288cc05cf2af2f094e007b417204373e7f35e867b"
  ],
